{.lead} Thank you for the conversation last week. Here is how I would approach the rebrand.

I have scoped the work into three phases, each with its own deliverable and a fixed price, so you can pause or continue after any one of them.

---

## Phase one
A direction sprint: an audit of the current brand, three territories to choose from, and a clear recommendation. One week.

---

## Phase two
We build the chosen direction into a core system: logo, color, type, and a small component kit. Two weeks.

---

## Phase three
Rollout: templates, a one page guideline, and a handover session. One week.

If the shape looks right, I will send a short agreement and we can book the kickoff for July.
